  lines:
  - speakerName: Admiral
    text: Loomville! You seem lost as a sailor without a compass
    typeSpeed: 75
    soundEvent: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0410f7133cabfcc46a12e20a38f8f44c, type: 2}
    portraitSprite: {fileID: 0}
    portraitTint: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
    camera:
      shotPreset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e2e99b5b538b6914d99ce0ebfaca93f7, type: 2}
      targetSource: 3
      npcId: admiral
      targetTag: 
  - speakerName: Admiral
    text: You new around here?
    typeSpeed: 75
    soundEvent: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0410f7133cabfcc46a12e20a38f8f44c, type: 2}
    portraitSprite: {fileID: 0}
    portraitTint: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
    camera:
      shotPreset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e2e99b5b538b6914d99ce0ebfaca93f7, type: 2}
      targetSource: 3
      npcId: admiral
      targetTag: 
  - speakerName: '{playerName}'
    text: I don't belong here. What's going on?
    typeSpeed: 75
    soundEvent: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0410f7133cabfcc46a12e20a38f8f44c, type: 2}
    portraitSprite: {fileID: 0}
    portraitTint: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
    camera:
      shotPreset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e2e99b5b538b6914d99ce0ebfaca93f7, type: 2}
      targetSource: 2
      npcId: 
      targetTag: 
  - speakerName: Admiral
    text: Ah, the classic "wake up in a weird spot" tale
    typeSpeed: 75
    soundEvent: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0410f7133cabfcc46a12e20a38f8f44c, type: 2}
    portraitSprite: {fileID: 0}
    portraitTint: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
    camera:
      shotPreset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e2e99b5b538b6914d99ce0ebfaca93f7, type: 2}
      targetSource: 3
      npcId: admiral
      targetTag: 
  - speakerName: Admiral
    text: Sounds like you've been pulled into something bigger than a dog's dinner
    typeSpeed: 75
    soundEvent: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0410f7133cabfcc46a12e20a38f8f44c, type: 2}
    portraitSprite: {fileID: 0}
    portraitTint: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
    camera:
      shotPreset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e2e99b5b538b6914d99ce0ebfaca93f7, type: 2}
      targetSource: 3
      npcId: admiral
      targetTag: 
  - speakerName: Admiral
    text: Head to the lab. They're the folks who untangle these messes
    typeSpeed: 75
    soundEvent: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0410f7133cabfcc46a12e20a38f8f44c, type: 2}
    portraitSprite: {fileID: 0}
    portraitTint: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
    camera:
      shotPreset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e2e99b5b538b6914d99ce0ebfaca93f7, type: 2}
      targetSource: 3
      npcId: admiral
      targetTag: 
  - speakerName: '{playerName}'
    text: The lab? Where is that?
    typeSpeed: 75
    soundEvent: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0410f7133cabfcc46a12e20a38f8f44c, type: 2}
    portraitSprite: {fileID: 0}
    portraitTint: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
    camera:
      shotPreset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e2e99b5b538b6914d99ce0ebfaca93f7, type: 2}
      targetSource: 2
      npcId: 
      targetTag: 
  - speakerName: Admiral
    text: Just that way, past the twisty paths. Big building
    typeSpeed: 75
    soundEvent: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0410f7133cabfcc46a12e20a38f8f44c, type: 2}
    portraitSprite: {fileID: 0}
    portraitTint: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
    camera:
      shotPreset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 821c1e2854d5ef340979533b3aa2f7e5, type: 2}
      targetSource: 4
      npcId: 
      targetTag: Signal_Lab
  - speakerName: Admiral
    text: can't miss it. Smells like experiments and bad decisions
    typeSpeed: 75
    soundEvent: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0410f7133cabfcc46a12e20a38f8f44c, type: 2}
    portraitSprite: {fileID: 0}
    portraitTint: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
    camera:
      shotPreset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 821c1e2854d5ef340979533b3aa2f7e5, type: 2}
      targetSource: 4
      npcId: 
      targetTag: Signal_Lab
  - speakerName: Admiral
    text: 'Take care, and remember: In Loomville'
    typeSpeed: 75
    soundEvent: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0410f7133cabfcc46a12e20a38f8f44c, type: 2}
    portraitSprite: {fileID: 0}
    portraitTint: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
    camera:
      shotPreset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e2e99b5b538b6914d99ce0ebfaca93f7, type: 2}
      targetSource: 3
      npcId: admiral
      targetTag: 
  - speakerName: Admiral
    text: curiosity didn't kill the dog... It just minted into something new
    typeSpeed: 75
    soundEvent: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0410f7133cabfcc46a12e20a38f8f44c, type: 2}
    portraitSprite: {fileID: 0}
    portraitTint: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
